right;\" dir=\"rtl\"></p><p style=\"text-align: right; direction: rtl;\"><span>הפולינום השני שגוי :(</span></p><br><p></p>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["ta1", "ta2", "z1", "z2", "z3", "z4"], "nvariants": 50}